{{#if resume.skills}}
{{#if resume.skills.length}}
<div class="skills-narrative">
    <p>- Subject matter expert for Information Security Management Systems (ISMS) and ISO 27001.</p>
    <p>- Extensive experience coordinating global audit programmes for complex organisations.</p>
    <p>- Able to coordinate large numbers of stakeholders in diverse geographies and time zones.</p>
    <p>- Strong technical knowledge covering all aspects of information security, including</p>
    <ul class="skills-technical-list">
      <li>Risk management</li>
      <li>Compliance</li>
      <li>Security Awareness and Training</li>
      <li>Asset Management</li>
      <li>Software Development Security</li>
      <li>Access Control</li>
      <li>Incident Response</li>
      <li>Cryptography</li>
      <li>Network Security</li>
      <li>Business Continuity and Disaster Recovery</li>
    </ul>
    <p>- Thoroughly understands the information security compliance landscape, including a detailed understanding of</p>
    <ul class="skills-compliance-list">
      <li>ISO/IEC 27001:2013 and Information Security Management Systems (ISMS)</li>
      <li>ISO/IEC 27017:2015</li>
      <li>ISO/IEC 27018:2019</li>
      <li>ISO/IEC 27701:2019 and Privacy Information Management Systems (PIMS)</li>
      <li>ISO 22301:2019 and Business Continuity Management Systems (BCMS)</li>
      <li>CSA Star CCM</li>
      <li>SOC1/2/3 Reporting</li>
      <li>NEN 7510-1:2017</li>
      <li>Hébergeurs de Données de Santé</li>
      <li>GDPR</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}

{{#if resume.interests}}
{{#if resume.interests.length}}
<div class="interests-section">
  <h3>Interests</h3>
  {{#each resume.interests}}
  <div class="skills-category">
    {{#if name}}
    <h4>{{name}}</h4>
    {{/if}}
    
    {{#if keywords}}
    <div class="skills-list">
      {{join keywords ", "}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/each}}
</div>
{{/if}}
{{/if}}